• our ability to develop, maintain, and expand key relationships with manufacturers of TV and other streaming devices, Pay-TV operators, and content publishers;
• competition in the provision of entertainment offerings involving the distribution of digital content provided by third-party application and content providers through broadband;
• our need to raise additional debt or equity capital in order to pursue our business objectives or respond to opportunities, challenges, or unforeseen circumstances;
• legal obligations and potential liability or reputational harm related to our collection, storage, use, and other processing of personal and confidential information;
• intellectual property infringement claims and litigation resulting in significant costs or the loss of important intellectual property rights important to our products and services;
• our agreements to indemnify certain of our partners and customers if our technology is alleged to infringe on third parties’ intellectual property rights;
